"I've met some foxy women before but "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["this is new..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["This is the blessing of the many-tailed "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["one. I was lucky to be chosen, but not "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["lucky enough to be compatible enough."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Compatible? Wait, you were \"chosen\". "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Like Fera is?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [0, 3, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hai! This isn't the first ceremony. I "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["offered my body to the many-tailed one, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["but I wasn't able to be her vessel. We "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["can only hope Fera will be the one."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And that made you...this..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlondeMiko110", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Uh-huh! But you're not here to talk are "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you, you're here about the seal. Right?\\."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Tell, you what. Help me out, and I'll "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["get rid of it."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What do we have to do?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [0, 1, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["My Onee-chan is around here somewhere. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["She's like me, you know? But she's not "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so...good with others. Not like I am."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["An \"Ice Queen\" as they say."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Find her, and give her this. It should "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["help melt that ice queen's heart."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 126, "parameters": [269, 0, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Obtained Fox Fire!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But we don't even know who your "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["sister is? What's her name? Is she hot?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [0, 5, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ew, she's my own sister!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [0, 3, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Kidding, she's a raven haired hottie! "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No more hints though! Go on boys."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Give her that and then find me, then "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'll break the Fox seal."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [140, 140, 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [1, "Does \"Fox\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Not really. Sorry."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [2, "Does \"Flower\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Water? Nope. I am kind of thirsty "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["though."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [3, "Does \"Water\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["How are you asking me this? Are you "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["cheating or did our master on high mess "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["up somewhere?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 102, "parameters": [["Show her Suzume's List", "Talk to me", "Nevermind"], 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [0, ["Show her Suzume's List", "Talk to me", "Nevermind"]]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wow, that's some weird stuff you're "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["looking for! Isn't belladonna poisonous? "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Or am I thinking of something else?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [1, "Show her Suzume's List"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hai hai! I love being here with all "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the other miko! Everyone is so nice!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Most of the time at least. But I think "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["they're trying, and that's what matters!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I guess some have it harder than others. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Tomomi sometimes acts a bit high and "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["mighty, but I think she's just trying to "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["be mature for the younger maidens."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiFemale1", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I wonder if that's why she stays near "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the east wing so much...or maybe "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["she just prefers the company of the "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["men, instead of the other maidens."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [2, "Talk to me"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 5, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "Miko Sprite Set 2", "characterIndex": 2, "direction": 8, "pattern": 1}}, {"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": true, "selfSwitchValid": false, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 140, "variableValue": 2, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 108, "parameters": ["extra conditions"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 408, "parameters": ["variable 132 = 2"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlondeMiko65", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ohayo Onii-san. Given my sister the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["fox fire yet? You only get one hint"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["from me, she's got black hair."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 140, 0, 4, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You could have warned us."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["*giggle*\\. Guess it worked then?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh yes."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["She says to stop drugging her, she "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["doesn't need your help."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Pfft...\\.hai hai. No more pranks...\\.for now."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Anyway, I promised to get rid of that "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["seal right? Consider it done."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [140, 140, 0, 0, 5]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [131, 131, 1, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 250, "parameters": [{"name": "Magic2", "pitch": 150, "volume": 80}]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 131, 0, 8, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["That's all three seals."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Time to go save Fera?"]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Definitely."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 122, "parameters": [37, 37, 0, 0, 152]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "Miko Inari Set", "characterIndex": 1, "direction": 2, "pattern": 1}}, {"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": true, "selfSwitchValid": false, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 140, "variableValue": 5, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 108, "parameters": ["extra conditions"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 408, "parameters": ["variable 132 = 2"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlondeMiko65", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC1B", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ohayo Onii-san. Having fun with "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yuuka's little \"quest\"?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 235, "parameters": [1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "Miko Inari Set", "characterIndex": 1, "direction": 2, "pattern": 1}}]}, {"id": 4, "name": "Rina 4", "x": 8, "y": 9, "pa