ameters": ["Why not ask her?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 140, 0, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 122, "parameters": [140, 140, 0, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [1, "Does \"Fox\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Flower? Oh...I see. That beautiful "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["silver one is what you seek. Try "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["looking outside. That particular "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["flower is usually around there."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 141, 0, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 122, "parameters": [141, 141, 0, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [2, "Does \"Flower\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Water is for drinking and bathing. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Little else. Though, I prefer to "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["drink...other things."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [3, "Does \"Water\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Inari? We may live under the same roof, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["but don't think I'm of the same ilk as "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that rat. I feel for her sister though."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No wonder she's not much of a talker..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 102, "parameters": [["Show her Suzume's List", "Talk to me", "Nevermind"], 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [0, ["Show her Suzume's List", "Talk to me", "Nevermind"]]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I've no idea. Seems like a waste of "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["time to me. Is this a shopping list? "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh, ginseng! Are you cooking? If you "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["are...\\.let me know."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [1, "Show her Suzume's List"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["*sigh*\\. I understand everyone is working "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hard preparing and getting ready for the "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["ceremony, but it's important we all "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["prepare by eating well, isn't it?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I believe it's Youko-san's turn to cook "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["tonight. I swear, that girl...I'm not "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["sure if she's just lazy, or genuinely "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hates being here."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiNPC", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["She seems to actively avoid the rest "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["of us. Well, except Megumi. Those two "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["are peas in a pod. Both seem to spend "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["more time outside than in."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [2, "Talk to me"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 5, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "Miko Sprite Set 2", "characterIndex": 1, "direction": 6, "pattern": 1}}]}, {"id": 5, "name": "Light", "x": 0, "y": 0, "pages": [{"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": false, "selfSwitchValid": false, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 1, "variableValue": 0, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 132, 0, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[0, 0, 0, 0], 30, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 132, 0, 1, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[0, -17, 0, 0], 30, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 132, 0, 2, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[-17, -34, -17, 0], 30, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 132, 0, 3, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[-34, -51, -17, 17], 30, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 132, 0, 4, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[-68, -68, -51, 17], 30, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {